      "source": "https://visitkosciuskocounty.org/explore/communities/winona-lake/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Miller Sunset Pavilion, built on the former Billy Sunday Tabernacle site, reflects the town’s historic religious roots.",
